OL,3,ARapid changes to care market risk to
OL,4,ANational Care Service, regulator says
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrivate companies buying up care homes
OL,7,Ffor older people in England could
OL,8,Fundermine the government's plan to
OL,9,Fcreate a universal care service, the
OL,10,Fregulator says.
OL,12,FThe Care Quality Commission's annual
OL,13,Freport highlights how a rising share of
OL,14,Fthe care home market is owned by large
OL,15,Ffirms - the five biggest increased
OL,16,Ftheir share by 26% in the last two
OL,17,Fyears, driven by interest from US
OL,18,Fproperty investors, and now own one in
OL,19,Fseven homes.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
