OL,3,ARapid changes to care market risk to
OL,4,ANational Care Service, regulator says
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile there can be benefits, there are
OL,7,Fconcerns the trend can lead to higher
OL,8,Fprices and a reduction in quality.
OL,10,FThe regulator said rapid changes to the
OL,11,Fmarket, including the fragmentation of
OL,12,Fhome help into more smaller services,
OL,13,Fneeded monitoring and clearer planning.
